 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "EVM 是一台单线程的栈式计算机。每个合约，有自己的代码和存储。",
   "spoken": "EVM 是一台单线程的栈式计算机。每个合约，有自己的代码和存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "合约之间，靠消息调用来通信。每一次调用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "spoken": "合约之间，靠消息掉用来通信。每一次掉用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.204,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 8.302,
   "speechEnd": 14.216
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "链上有两类账户。",
   "spoken": "链上有两类账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 15.288,
   "dur": 2.448,
   "speechStart": 15.386,
   "speechEnd": 16.886
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "外部账户叫 EOA，由私钥控制，能主动发起交易。",
   "spoken": "外部账户叫 EOA，由私钥控制，能主动发起交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.956,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 18.054,
   "speechEnd": 22.042
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "合约账户由代码控制，不能主动发起，只能被调用。",
   "spoken": "合约账户由代码控制，不能主动发起，只能被掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.096,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 23.194,
   "speechEnd": 27.194
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "但这条界线在变。2025 年 5 月，以太坊 Pectra 升级上线了 EIP-7702，EOA 可以委托执行一段合约代码。",
   "spoken": "但这条界线在变。2025 年 5 月，以太坊 Pectra 升级上线了 EIP-7702，EOA 可以委托执行一段合约代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.236,
   "dur": 10.872,
   "speechStart": 28.334,
   "speechEnd": 38.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "所以，查对方有没有代码，已经不能判断它是不是普通用户。比较 msg.sender 和 tx.origin，也不行。",
   "spoken": "所以，查对方有没有代码，已经不能判断它是不是普通用户。比较 msg.sender 和 tx.origin，也不行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 39.328,
   "dur": 10.152,
   "speechStart": 39.426,
   "speechEnd": 48.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "再看调用上下文。假设用户调用合约 A，A 调用 B，B 再调用 C。",
   "spoken": "再看掉用上下文。假设用户掉用合约 A，A 掉用 B，B 再掉用 C。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 49.7,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 49.798,
   "speechEnd": 55.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "站在 C 的位置，看四个变量。",
   "spoken": "站在 C 的位置，看四个变量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 56.832,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 56.93,
   "speechEnd": 59.144
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "tx.origin，是发起整笔交易的用户。",
   "spoken": "tx.origin，是发起整笔交易的用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 60.196,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 60.294,
   "speechEnd": 63.425
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "msg.sender，是直接调用 C 的那一个，也就是 B。",
   "spoken": "msg.sender，是直接掉用 C 的那一个，也就是 B。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 64.496,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 64.594,
   "speechEnd": 68.606
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "msg.value，是这次调用附带的原生币，也就是 B 转给 C 的数量。",
   "spoken": "msg.value，是这次掉用附带的原生币，也就是 B 转给 C 的数量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 69.636,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 69.734,
   "speechEnd": 74.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "address(this)，是当前执行代码的合约，也就是 C 自己。",
   "spoken": "address(this)，是当前执行代码的合约，也就是 C 自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 75.688,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 75.786,
   "speechEnd": 80.452
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "开头那个金库，该看的是 msg.sender，不是 tx.origin。",
   "spoken": "开头那个金库，该看的是 msg.sender，不是 tx.origin。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 81.5,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 81.598,
   "speechEnd": 86.788
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "合约之间怎么调用？有三种方式。",
   "spoken": "合约之间怎么掉用？有三种方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 87.84,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 87.938,
   "speechEnd": 90.757
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第一种 call，最常见。执行 B 的代码，改的是 B 的存储。",
   "spoken": "第一种 call，最常见。执行 B 的代码，改的是 B 的存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 91.828,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 91.926,
   "speechEnd": 96.507
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "第二种 delegatecall。执行的还是 B 的代码，改的却是 A 的存储。",
   "spoken": "第二种 delegatecall。执行的还是 B 的代码，改的却是 A 的存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 97.568,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 97.666,
   "speechEnd": 103.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "而且 msg.sender 和 msg.value 保持不变。代理合约和库合约，都依赖它。",
   "spoken": "而且 msg.sender 和 msg.value 保持不变。代理合约和库合约，都依赖它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 104.244,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 104.342,
   "speechEnd": 111.577
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "打个比方。EVM 像一个只有一个窗口的政务大厅，每个合约是一个科室。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。EVM 像一个只有一个窗口的政务大厅，每个合约是一个科室。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 112.624,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 112.722,
   "speechEnd": 118.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "call，是派人带着材料，去 B 的窗口办事。",
   "spoken": "call，是派人带着材料，去 B 的窗口办事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 119.516,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 119.614,
   "speechEnd": 122.697
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "delegatecall，是把 B 的规程手册借过来，在 A 自己的档案柜上照着办。",
   "spoken": "delegatecall，是把 B 的规程手册借过来，在 A 自己的档案柜上照着办。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 123.768,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 123.866,
   "speechEnd": 128.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "如果手册写着，清空 0 号抽屉，被清空的是 A 的抽屉。",
   "spoken": "如果手册写着，清空 0 号抽屉，被清空的是 A 的抽屉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 129.94,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 130.038,
   "speechEnd": 134.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。真实的大厅里，你离开窗口，就不能插队回来。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。真实的大厅里，你离开窗口，就不能插队回来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 135.104,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 135.202,
   "speechEnd": 141.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "EVM 里，B 办到一半，可以反过来再找 A。这时 A 的上一件事，还没办完。这就是重入。",
   "spoken": "EVM 里，B 办到一半，可以反过来再找 A。这时 A 的上一件事，还没办完。这就是虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 142.476,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 142.574,
   "speechEnd": 149.786
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "第三种 staticcall，是只读调用。任何写存储或发事件的操作，都会回滚。",
   "spoken": "第三种 staticcall，是只读掉用。任何写存储或发事件的操作，都会回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 150.856,
   "dur": 7.464,
   "speechStart": 150.954,
   "speechEnd": 157.487
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "还有一个坑。低级 call 失败时，不会自动让调用者回滚，只返回 false。",
   "spoken": "还有一个坑。低级 call 失败时，不会自动让掉用者回滚，只返回 false。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg2-25.mp3",
